{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And Bezalel made the ark.</b> It was first among all the vessels of the Tabernacle, for it is written: ״פתח דבריך יאיר״ — light was created first in the world, and therefore the ark, in which the Torah is placed — as it is said: ״כי נר מצוה ותורה אור״ — was made first. And you do not find the name of Bezalel attached to any vessel of all the vessels of the Tabernacle except the ark, because the name of Bezalel indicates ״צל אל״, and this is the notarikon of Bezalel. And this too is what the Sages said: the order of the making was according to his own understanding. Moses said to him: ״בצל אל היית״." "<b>Acacia wood.</b> Because they were destined to sin at Shittim, he established this for them to atone for the deed of Shittim."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:49.211422127Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}